---
title: Agent Roles & Data Flow
---

flowchart LR
    subgraph Inputs["📥 Inputs"]
        PDF["📕 PDF Files"]
        DOCX["📘 DOCX Files"]
        TXT["📄 TXT/MD Files"]
        TOPIC["📝 Essay Topic"]
    end

    subgraph DP["📄 Document Processor Agent"]
        direction TB
        DP_ROLE["**Role**: File Ingestion & Parsing"]
        DP_IN["**Inputs**:<br/>• Raw files"]
        DP_OUT["**Outputs**:<br/>• Extracted text<br/>• Document structure<br/>• Metadata"]
        DP_LLM["**LLM Usage**: Metadata extraction<br/>when not in file properties"]
    end

    subgraph CA["🧠 Content Analyst Agent"]
        direction TB
        CA_ROLE["**Role**: Deep Understanding"]
        CA_IN["**Inputs**:<br/>• Processed documents"]
        CA_OUT["**Outputs**:<br/>• Theme identification<br/>• Argument mapping<br/>• Semantic chunks"]
        CA_LLM["**LLM Usage**: Heavy<br/>Theme & argument analysis"]
    end

    subgraph QE["💬 Quote Extractor Agent"]
        direction TB
        QE_ROLE["**Role**: Relevance Detection"]
        QE_IN["**Inputs**:<br/>• Documents + Analysis<br/>• Essay topic"]
        QE_OUT["**Outputs**:<br/>• Verbatim quotes<br/>• Page locations<br/>• Relevance scores<br/>• Stance classification"]
        QE_LLM["**LLM Usage**: Heavy<br/>Relevance & stance analysis"]
    end

    subgraph RG["📖 Reference Generator Agent"]
        direction TB
        RG_ROLE["**Role**: Citation Formatting"]
        RG_IN["**Inputs**:<br/>• Document metadata<br/>• Quote locations"]
        RG_OUT["**Outputs**:<br/>• Harvard full refs<br/>• In-text citations<br/>• Bibliography"]
        RG_LLM["**LLM Usage**: Light<br/>Format validation"]
    end

    subgraph SA["🔗 Synthesis Agent"]
        direction TB
        SA_ROLE["**Role**: Final Assembly"]
        SA_IN["**Inputs**:<br/>• All quotes<br/>• All references<br/>• Analysis results"]
        SA_OUT["**Outputs**:<br/>• Clustered quotes<br/>• Argument map<br/>• Final report"]
        SA_LLM["**LLM Usage**: Medium<br/>Clustering & summarization"]
    end

    subgraph Outputs["📤 Outputs"]
        JSON["📋 JSON Data"]
        MD["📝 Markdown Report"]  
        BIB["📚 Bibliography"]
    end

    %% Data Flow
    PDF --> DP
    DOCX --> DP
    TXT --> DP
    
    DP --> |"ProcessedDocument"| CA
    TOPIC --> QE
    CA --> |"ContentAnalysis"| QE
    DP --> |"DocumentMetadata"| RG
    QE --> |"ExtractedQuotes"| RG
    QE --> |"ExtractedQuotes"| SA
    RG --> |"References"| SA
    CA --> |"Themes"| SA
    
    SA --> JSON
    SA --> MD
    RG --> BIB
